      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Lead intake orchestration\nFastAPI stores each lead and an outbox event in one transaction; the dispatcher posts the event here with a short-lived signed token. **Verify event** checks the token was issued for exactly this payload. The run is linked to the event, then the API says which step the lead needs next, so replays and resumed events continue where the lead stands.",
